  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :&nbsp;</strong><a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://updeled.gov.in/DefaultDELED.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Examination Regulation Authority Allahabad Uttar Pradesh</a>&nbsp;</span>has released the Allotment Result for the Examination of UP BTC/ DELED Admission 2026. Online Counselling process for UP Deled Admission 2026 has started on 10 August 2026 &amp; the candidates can apply till 14 September 2026. Candidates who appeared for this online counselling can download their Allotment Result 2026 from the link given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UP DELEd 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UP DELEd Admission Online Counselling / Rank Card 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>15 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <b>03 August 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date Fee Payment : <strong>04 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date Submission Form : <strong>05 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffff00;\">Online Counselling : <strong>10 August 2026 to 14 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Choice Filling Date : <strong>11 to 13 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Allotment Result : <b>21 August 2026</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General / OBC : <strong>Rs. 700/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST : <strong>Rs. 500 /-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PH : <strong>Rs. 200 /-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP DELEd Notification 2026 : Age Limit as on 01 July 2026.</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>35 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UP Deled Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Use</span> <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UP DELEd Application Form 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates Must Have Bachelor’s Degree in any stream with a minimum of 50% marks. For SC/ST candidates, a minimum of 45% marks is required.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">All candidates must thoroughly read the official notification before applying</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP DELEd Online Form 2026 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Rank Card</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Check UP DELEd Allotment Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Check the Important Links section.</li>\n<li>Then click on the Allotment Result link.</li>\n<li>After clicking on the link, candidates will be redirected to the Dashboard page.</li>\n<li>In this page candidates have to fill up the following fields with proper details:<br>\n<strong>Candidate’s Registration Number</strong><br>\n<strong>Date of Birth</strong><br>\n<strong>Gender</strong><br>\n<strong>Verification Code</strong></li>\n<li>Then the candidates will be required to submit the details in order to fill the allotment result.</li>\n<li>The candidate can also download their allotment result from the official Website.</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Our Instagram Channel</strong></